data: {"agent":"coordinator","agent_tab":"coordinator","event":{"output":"{\"content\":\"# Daily Self-Evolution Monitor — Day 01\\n## Task Family: `audit_summary`\\n**Date:** 2026-05-25  \\n**Evidence Sources:** precipitation_seed, reuse_followup, optimization_probe, duplicate_merge_probe, archive_readiness_probe  \\n**Stable Refs:** R1–R9 (defined in precipitation_seed §1)  \\n**Counters:** C1–C25 (bounded integers, enumerated in precipitation_seed §2)  \\n\\n---\\n\\n## 1. Scope\\n\\nThis audit summarizes all day-01 self-evolution monitor probes using **only stable refs** and **aggregate bounded counts**. No raw payloads, no application-specific business logic, no provider names, no secrets. All figures are cross-referenced from the four probe artifacts (reuse_followup, optimization_probe, duplicate_merge_probe, archive_readiness_probe) plus the precipitation_seed baseline.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## 2. Aggregate Counter Snapshot (End of Day 01)\\n\\n| ID | Counter | Value | Δ from Baseline | Signal |\\n|----|---------|-------|-----------------|--------|\\n| C1 | Governance artifact files | **59** | +11 | 📈 Monotonic growth |\\n| C2 | Governance total lines | **14,018** | +5,518 | 📈 Monotonic growth |\\n| C3 | Verification artifacts (triple-marker) | **6** | 0 | ✅ Stable |\\n| C4 | `available_skills/` directories | **26** | +2 | 📈 New pipeline-produced dirs |\\n| C5 | Convention-compliant dirs (SKILL.md + `_meta.json`) | **4** | 0 | ✅ Stable |\\n| C6 | Pipeline-produced dirs with `proposal_id` in meta | **0** | 0 | ✅ Stable |\\n| C7 | `_meta.json` with `proposal_id` field | **0** | 0 | ✅ Stable |\\n| C8 | Agent replay log files | **3** | 0 | ✅ Stable |\\n| C9 | Agent replay events (total) | **10** | 0 | ✅ Stable |\\n| C10 | Agent stop events with `duration_ms` | **5** | 0 | ✅ Stable |\\n| C11 | Missions in mission-state.json | **3** | 0 | ✅ Stable |\\n| C12 | Agents across all missions | **5** | 0 | ✅ Stable |\\n| C13 | Non-null `completedSummary` values | **0** | 0 | ✅ Stable (Contract C1 unfilled) |\\n| C14 | `.registry.json` files | **0** |...[truncated, 16841 bytes]","tool_name":"file_read","type":"tool_result"},"task_id":"44fab8fb-ee34-479c-bb82-43f84048514b"}

