ilure reason per skill invocation | `last-tool-error.json` with `retry_count` + `skill_...[truncated, 2922 bytes]","tool_name":"shell","type":"tool_result"},"task_id":"44fab8fb-ee34-479c-bb82-43f84048514b"}

