data: {"agent":"coordinator","agent_tab":"coordinator","output":"Report created successfully at `shared/self_evolution_2026-05-26_day-02_duplicate_merge_probe.md` — **564 lines, 42,376 bytes**.\n\n### Executive Summary of Findings\n\n**Critical discovery: Clone family exploded 67% in one cycle** — the auto-generated template-clone family grew from **9 → 15 skills** with **6 new template-identical skills** precipitated between day-01 and day-02.\n\n| Day-01 (May 25) | Day-02 (May 26) | Change |\n|---|---|---|\n| 26 total skills | **32 total skills** | +6 |\n| 9 clone skills (35%) | **15 clone skills (47%)** | +6 (+67%) |\n| 3 materialization | **7 materialization** | +4 new |\n| 1 telemetry | **3 telemetry/evaluation** | +2 new |\n| 1 linked eval skill | — | +1 new |\n\n**6 new auto-generated skills** (all using the identical template with keyword substitution only):\n1. `evaluation_telemetry_optimization`\n2. `linked_event_execution_trace_refs_repeat_involving_evaluation`\n3. `materialization_governance_telemetry_optimization`\n4. `materialization_registry_load_path_activation_telemetry`\n5. `materialization_telemetry_validation_optimization`\n6. `telemetry_registry`\n\n**Key recommendations:**\n\n| Priority | Action | Details |\n|---|---|---|\n| **🔴 G2 Gate** | Halt new clones at pipeline | Template-hash dedup gate — standalone fix, no merge needed |\n| **P1** | Merge 10 keyword-variant clones → 1 unified | Expanded from day-01's 3-skill merge |\n| **P2** | Suppress 5 experimental skills | Unchanged from day-01 |\n| **P3** | Merge figma_mcp → figma | Unchanged from day-01 |\n\n**No files were mutated.** The report identifies the accelerating clone problem and proposes a pipeline gate (template-hash dedup) as a standalone fix that doesn't require the blocked `_meta.json` or `.registry.json` infrastructure.","success":true,"task_id":"44fab8fb-ee34-479c-bb82-43f84048514b"}

